script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7277488595,"name":"七叔（叶泽浩）Launch Party","desc":"Pop artist  七叔（叶泽浩） is hosting his first Launch Party exclusively on Luobu where he will be performing 10 of his best known tracks.  Showtimes for the performance are Sep,19, 8pm-9pm (China Time) with encore performance Sep. 20, 1pm-5pm, 8pm-10pm (China Time) and Sep. 21, 9am-9pm (China Time).  Come check out the 是七叔呢 Launch Party where you can:\r\n\r\n- Dance to 七叔（叶泽浩）'s latest performance and hits\r\n\r\n- Engage in scavenger hunts to win free merch\r\n\r\n- Compete in QQ Music’s obstacle course tower\r\n\r\n- Collect gold coins to buy avatar accessories to celebrate the performance\r\n\r\n- Earn fandom points and have a statue of your avatar displayed\r\n\r\n","path":"/game/7277488595-launch-party","slug":"7277488595-launch-party","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0caa2736c3f6ed237aad4e34a411309c978f27a1639d7246b3acc750995b5b84.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-34f219df2313e5cae9e664154f32d914/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":14644140,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-03T02:04:17.501Z","creator":{"name":"QQ音乐","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7009799230,"name":"Pressure Wash Simulator","desc":"Welcome to Roblox Pressure Washing Simulator, the most satisfying simulator game on Roblox! In this power washing tycoon and simulator, you can roleplay as a power washer with your friends, from cleaning vans to cars, houses, gardens and more! \r\n\r\nUpgrade your power wash guns for better pressure to wash more efficiently especially with larger nozzles! More pressure takes more water from the tank, so make sure to upgrade your tanks too!\r\n\r\n📝UPDATE LOG:\r\n- 10 New Cleanable Areas in a new world!\r\n\r\n👍LIKE THE GAME FOR NEW UPDATES!👍\r\n\r\nFollow the game to know when there's a new update so you don't miss out!\r\n\r\nMade with ❤️ by\r\nSub & Fluff\r\n\r\nSpecial thanks to FallenAngel, Jaka, BlueGrass and Starmaq! Inspired by Power Wash Simulator on Steam! \r\nPost bugs & suggestions in the group below!","path":"/game/7009799230-pressure-wash-simulator","slug":"7009799230-pressure-wash-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b36706b3d08ea016e3101d2fd15d775ccf1ed607d946f1b2b4aa01142fd141aa.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-364612a445c3c9071b2455803d16991e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":141105997,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-06T17:57:01.085Z","creator":{"name":"Small World Games - Tycoons!","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":11,"freeCount":11,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":2}},{"id":6441847031,"name":"CHAOS [EVENT]","desc":"Welcome to Chaos!\n\n[NEW UPDATE v1.4: We added a Mobile Button And Reverted Old HitBox as requested ]\n\nA fun fighting game where you can slap people to the afterlife. This game is in early stages and might contain a lot of bugs!\n\nControls:\nCTRL - Shiftlock\nE - Dash\nF - Carry","path":"/game/6441847031-chaos","slug":"6441847031-chaos","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3d4cd3ce76d580801e5742756aff5846b14500a0bcb4f7208189b8fa1566a6c2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c26d9afd8c7311fdbed081c81f4a4758/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":134886218,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-16T19:24:58.439Z","creator":{"name":"Animus Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":35,"freeCount":34,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":6644653750,"name":"Paper.IO","desc":"Game rules:\r\n1.At first, you have a deep color area under your feet.\r\n2.Run around and you will get the light color footprint.\r\n3.Try to make a circle and back to the deep color areas you got before.\r\n4.The player who gets most colored areas wins\r\n\r\nNotice:\r\nDon't be surrounded by others","path":"/game/6644653750-paper-io","slug":"6644653750-paper-io","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/890bcb9f35082d4f2fd40b6d8b9e8865bea